 e 48\, Berlin
DESCRIPTION:Milonga: ------- ^^^ ------ ENTRANCE click on the play button a
 bove\n==================================================\n\n!!! A C H T U 
 N G !!!\n\nHeute\, am 16.10.2026\, findet La Milonga "Los Viernes Matinée
 " nicht statt!\nStattdessen am SONNTAG\, den 18. Oktober \n- von 17- 22.30
  Uhr\n-  im Rathaus Schöneberg\, Saal 0170\n----------------------\n\n\n\
 nToday\, on Friday\, you are welcome to join us @ Los Viernes Matinée \n\
 nCome and let´s embrace each other\, taste the wonderful tandas \n- from 
 Dj \;-)\n- Admission to Milonga: €10 per person\n\nHauptstr. 48\, 10827 
 Berlin. Pls use the left side garden path for getting to Paul-Gerhardt Saa
 l.\n\n- Free parking from 6 pm on Dominicusstr.\n- Parkgebührenfrei ab 18
  Uhr in der Dominicusstr.\n----------\nQuelle: https://www.facebook.com/hs
 iao.w.wendy\n\nVeranstalter: Berlinos Aires Milonga\n\nhttps://www.hoy-mil
 onga.com/berlin/de/milonga/491918/Los-Viernes-Matinee
URL:https://www.hoy-milonga.com/berlin/de/milonga/491918/Los-Viernes-Matine
 e
