DESCRIPTION:Milonga: El Chamuyo\n----------\nWe’re so excited! El Chamuyo
  is turning one\, and we want to celebrate the anniversary with you.\n\nEl
  Chamuyo - anniversary edition\n- 16th October | 11:00 PM – 4:00 AM\n- D
 J: Eva Guerrero from Buenos Aires\n- ChamuShow: surprise \n- Entrance: €
 10\n\nOur event draws inspiration from the milongas of Buenos Aires and th
 e spirit of connection. We celebrate and encourage social interaction and 
 coming together as a fundamental part of welcoming all dancers into the wo
 rld of tango—from those who simply want to dance to those who just want 
 to chat\, as well as newcomers.\n\nWe have plenty of surprises for this ed
 ition!\n- 1st Price - MIlonga pass for Festivaliki Athens Tango and Berlin
  Tango Vibe in Greece.\n\n2nd Price - Workshop with Pamela & Fernando\n3rd
  Price - 20% DIscount in LaMalisa dresses\n4th Price - 2 entrance + 1 drin
 k for Next chamuyo\n5th Price - One Prosecco Bottle\n6th Price - 1 goody b
 ag with surprises.\n7th Price - 1 goody bag with surprises.\n8th Price - 1
  goody bag with surprises.\n9th Price - 1 goody bag with surprises.\n10th 
 Price - 1 goody bag with surprises.\n----------\nQuelle: https://www.faceb
 ook.com/events/2332070430978885\n\nVeranstalter: El Chamuyo - Berlin\n\nht
 tps://www.hoy-milonga.com/berlin/de/milonga/499360/El-Chamuyo---1-YEAR
URL:https://www.hoy-milonga.com/berlin/de/milonga/499360/El-Chamuyo---1-YEA
 R
STATUS:CONFIRMED
