DESCRIPTION:Milonga: OPEN END - Milonga\n----------\nProgram\n- 20:00 Doors
  open\n\n​20:15 Tango classes on donation\n- Beginners class\n- Structur
 e of tango movement class\n\n​22:00 Milonga Party\n- Full line-up on our
  Instagram stories — take a look!\n\n​Pricing\n- Classes on donation\n
 - USC accepted (+ 5€ / low budget 3€​ for the party)\n\n- Milonga 10
 € / low budget 8€​\n- Milonga & Class 10€-20€​ - donation base
 d\n\n​Location​\n- Ballhaus Studios - Kottbusser Damm 76\, 10967 Berli
 n Kreuzberg\n- U8 Schönleinstraße or U8 Hermannplatz\n\n​Bar collectiv
 o\n- We provide a buffet\, and drinks will be available (donation based).\
 n- Feel free to bring your own drinks to share.\n\n​- Dresscode\nIt's Fr
