 peritif - 18:00 -19:00\n\nPRACTICA\nA Taste of Tango\n\nA relaxed space to
  practice together\, share ideas\, and ask anything you’d like.\nA first
  sip of rhythm- a slow awakening for the senses\n\n- Main Course - 19:00
 –22:00\nLa Milonguita Nota Negra\n\nFull-bodied tandas by \n- DJ ZAP\n\n
 Best enjoyed with drinks\, served alongside with tempting bites \;)…\n\n
  Lean in. Let the night melt on your tongue\, each step a lingering bite o
 f dark chocolate\, each glance a sip of red wine\, let your steps follow t
 he flavor of the music. \n\nNOIRcafé\, Graefestraße 82\n10967 Berlin\n--
 --------\nQuelle: https://www.facebook.com/philip.kojo.96\n\nVeranstalter:
  Philip Kojo \n\nhttps://www.hoy-milonga.com/berlin/de/milonga/492858/La-M
 ilonguita-Nota-Negra
